line-capital-group/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="1"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/"><img alt="Change et tr&eacute;sorerie" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/exchange-market.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">02 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Change et tr&eacute;sorerie</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)</a></h3><p>Des op&eacute;rations financi&egrave;res guid&eacute;es par la clart&eacute;, la rigueur et l&rsquo;information.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="2"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Property Management" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/"><img alt="Gestion immobili&egrave;re" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/property-architecture.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">03 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Gestion immobili&egrave;re</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/">Blue Line Property Management</a></h3><p>Prendre soin des lieux o&ugrave; l&rsquo;on vit, travaille et construit l&rsquo;avenir.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="2"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Construction" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-construction/"><img alt="Construction et infrastructures" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/construction-infrastructure.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">04 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Construction et infrastructures</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-construction/">Blue Line Construction</a></h3><p>Quand la qualit&eacute; d&rsquo;ex&eacute;cution donne une forme concr&egrave;te &agrave; l&rsquo;ambition.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-construction/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="3"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Sugar Manufacturing" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/"><img alt="Production industrielle" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/sugar-manufacturing.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">05 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Production industrielle</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/">Blue Line Sugar Manufacturing</a></h3><p>Une vision industrielle, de la mati&egrave;re premi&egrave;re au produit fini.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="3"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Importation, Assembly &amp; Trade" class="card-photo" href